    "Varied Condition 3:The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and thereafter maintained as such for the lifetime of the development: NPS-DR-(00)-101 Rev P1 (Existing Site Plan), NPS-DR-(00)-100 P1 (Location Plan), NPS-DR-(00)-101 P1, NPS-DR-B-(00)-103 (Proposed Floor and Elevation Plan – Office Accommodation Block), NPS-DR-B-(00)-102 Rev P1 (Proposed Floor and Elevation Plan Workshop), NPS-DR-B-(00)-104 (Proposed Floor Plan – Welfare Units), NPS-DR-B-(00)-104 (Proposed Floor and Elevation Plan – Welfare Units), Planning Statement, Assessment of Fluvial Flood Risk - Issue Number 3 (dated 12/08/2019), Phase II – Site Investigation Report – Ref: C14653 (dated March 2019), 10119-SIB-01-XX\u0002M2-W-032 Rev S4 dated 10/06/2024, 10119-SIB-01-GF-M3- W-010 Rev S0 dated 26/07/2019 and NPS-DR- (00)-101A Rev A (Proposed Site Plan) – dated 08/08/2019. Reason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.",
    "Varied condition 2:This permission shall endure for a limited period not exceeding 31 December 2044. Prior to the temporary permission expiring, the use hereby permitted shall cease and any development carried out under this permission or other enabling development shall be removed and the land restored to its former state or as otherwise agreed with the Local Planning Authority and thereafter retained as such. Reason: To enable the Local Planning Authority to review the suitability of the development in the light of circumstances prevailing at the end of the above period and in the interests of the amenities of the area, in accordance with Policies&nbsp;D4 (Delivering Good Design) of the London Plan 2021 and 53 (delivering high quality design) of the Waltham Forest Local Plan 2024."
